  "prefLabel": "Lot 216.02 Standard and Burden of Proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 216.02 Standard and Burden of Proof. The party asserting a proposition shall bear the burden of proving the truth of the proposition by a preponderance of the evidence, which means a demonstration by admissible evidence that a fact or legal conclusion is more probable than not to be true.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Lot 200) #12093, eff 1-27-17 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Lot 200)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot200.html"
